<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
  <title><%= targetGuild.name %> • SANGUINIS AUDIT</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/sweetalert2@11"></script>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@700;800;900&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');
    
    body {
      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
      background-color: #08080a;
    }
    
    .font-arcane {
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
    }

    ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 5px; height: 5px; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #08080a; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #450a0a; border-radius: 4px; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #991b1b; }

    /* SweetAlert2 Custom Dark Blood Theme */
    .sanguinis-swal {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #09090b 0%, #15090b 100%) !important;
      border: 1px solid #991b1b !important;
      box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.3), 0 25px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9) !important;
      border-radius: 20px !important;
      padding: 1.5rem !important;
    }

    .sanguinis-swal .swal2-title {
      color: #fef2f2 !important;
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif !important;
      font-weight: 800 !important;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em !important;
      font-size: 1.25rem !important;
    }

    .sanguinis-swal .swal2-html-container {
      color: #cbd5e1 !important;
      font-size: 0.9rem !important;
      line-height: 1.5 !important;
    }

    .sanguinis-swal .swal2-confirm {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #800020 0%, #dc2626 100%) !important;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      border-radius: 12px !important;
      font-weight: 700 !important;
      font-size: 0.85rem !important;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem !important;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.4) !important;
      border: 1px solid rgba(254, 202, 202, 0.2) !important;
    }

    .sanguinis-swal .swal2-cancel {
      background: #18181b !important;
      color: #94a3b8 !important;
      border-radius: 12px !important;
      font-weight: 600 !important;
      font-size: 0.85rem !important;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem !important;
      border: 1px solid #27272a !important;
    }

    .sanguinis-swal .swal2-icon.swal2-success {
      border-color: #10b981 !important;
      color: #10b981 !important;
    }

    .sanguinis-swal .swal2-icon.swal2-error {
      border-color: #dc2626 !important;
      color: #dc2626 !important;
    }

    .sanguinis-swal .swal2-icon.swal2-warning {
      border-color: #f59e0b !important;
      color: #f59e0b !important;
    }

    /* Custom Switch Toggle Glowing */
    .sanguinis-switch:checked ~ .switch-dot {
      transform: translateX(100%);
      background-color: #ffffff;
    }
    .sanguinis-switch:checked ~ .switch-bg {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #800020 0%, #dc2626 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.55);
      border-color: #ef4444;
    }

    .glass-card {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(18, 18, 24, 0.9) 0%, rgba(13, 13, 18, 0.96) 100%);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(153, 27, 27, 0.35);
    }

    .glass-card:hover {
      border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.5);
    }

    .tab-btn.active {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(128, 0, 32, 0.9) 0%, rgba(153, 27, 27, 0.8) 100%);
      border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.7);
      color: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.3);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="text-gray-200 min-h-screen flex flex-col selection:bg-red-900 selection:text-white pb-24 lg:pb-6 overflow-x-hidden">

  <!-- ================= TOP MOBILE HEADER BAR (< 1024px) ================= -->
  <header class="lg:hidden sticky top-0 z-40 h-16 bg-[#0d0d12]/95 backdrop-blur-xl border-b border-red-950/80 px-4 flex items-center justify-between">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <button type="button" id="btn_open_drawer" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#14141c] border border-red-900/50 text-gray-300 hover:text-white flex items-center justify-center transition" aria-label="Mở menu máy chủ">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-bars text-base"></i>
      </button>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <% if (targetGuild.icon) { %>
          <img src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/icons/<%= targetGuild.id %>/<%= targetGuild.icon %>.png" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg border border-red-800/60 object-cover" alt="<%= targetGuild.name %>">
        <% } else { %>
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-950 border border-red-800/60 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-red-400">
            <%= targetGuild.name.charAt(0).toUpperCase() %>
          </div>
        <% } %>
        <span class="font-bold text-sm text-white truncate max-w-[150px] sm:max-w-[220px]"><%= targetGuild.name %></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <button type="button" onclick="submitConfiguration(event)" class="h-9 px-3 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-red-800 to-red-600 text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(220,38,38,0.4)]">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-floppy-disk text-xs"></i>
        <span>Lưu</span>
      </button>
      <a href="/logout" class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-[#14141c] border border-red-950 text-gray-400 hover:text-red-400 flex items-center justify-center" title="Đăng Xuất">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-from-bracket text-xs"></i>
      </a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ================= TOP DESKTOP HEADER (>= 1024px) ================= -->
  <header class="hidden lg:flex sticky top-0 z-30 h-16 bg-[#0d0d12]/95 backdrop-blur-xl border-b border-red-950/80 px-6 items-center justify-between">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3 group">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-950 via-red-900 to-black border border-red-700/60 flex items-center justify-center text-lg shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(220,38,38,0.3)] group-hover:scale-105 transition">
          🩸
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="font-arcane tracking-[0.2em] text-white font-black text-base leading-none block">SANGUINIS</span>
          <span class="text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-red-500 font-semibold">Giao Thức Huyết Ấn</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <div class="h-5 w-px bg-red-950/80"></div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <% if (targetGuild.icon) { %>
          <img src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/icons/<%= targetGuild.id %>/<%= targetGuild.icon %>.png" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg border border-red-800/60 object-cover" alt="<%= targetGuild.name %>">
        <% } else { %>
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-950 border border-red-800/60 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-red-400">
            <%= targetGuild.name.charAt(0).toUpperCase() %>
          </div>
        <% } %>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-white text-xs font-bold leading-tight flex items-center gap-2">
            <%= targetGuild.name %>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-950/40 border border-emerald-800/30 px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded font-mono">ID: <%= targetGuild.id %></span>
          </h2>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Actions & User -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
      <div id="desktop_save_status" class="text-xs font-medium text-emerald-400 flex items-center gap-1.5">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
        <span>Đã đồng bộ</span>
      </div>

      <button type="button" onclick="submitConfiguration(event)" class="h-10 px-5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-red-900 via-red-800 to-red-600 hover:from-red-800 hover:to-red-500 text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-2 transition duration-200 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(220,38,38,0.35)] border border-red-500/40">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-floppy-disk text-sm"></i>
        <span>Lưu Cấu Hình</span>
      </button>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-[#121218] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border border-red-950/80">
        <% if (user.avatar) { %>
          <img src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatars/<%= user.id %>/<%= user.avatar %>.png" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full border border-red-900/60 object-cover" alt="<%= user.username %>">
        <% } else { %>
          <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-red-950 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-bold text-red-400">
            <%= user.username.charAt(0).toUpperCase() %>
          </div>
        <% } %>
        <span class="text-white text-xs font-bold leading-none"><%= user.username %></span>
      </div>

      <a href="/logout" title="Đăng Xuất" class="h-9 w-9 rounded-xl bg-[#121218] hover:bg-red-950/60 border border-red-950/80 hover:border-red-600/50 text-gray-400 hover:text-red-400 flex items-center justify-center transition">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-from-bracket text-xs"></i>
      </a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ================= MOBILE DRAWER MENU (< 1024px) ================= -->
  <div id="mobile_drawer_backdrop" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-md z-50 hidden transition-opacity duration-300">
    <div id="mobile_drawer" class="w-80 max-w-[85vw] h-full bg-[#0d0d12] border-r border-red-950/80 p-5 flex flex-col justify-between overflow-y-auto transform -translate-x-full transition-transform duration-300">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-4 mb-4 border-b border-red-950/60">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-900/80 flex items-center justify-center text-lg">🩸</div>
            <span class="font-arcane font-bold text-white text-base tracking-wider">MÁY CHỦ</span>
          </div>
          <button type="button" id="btn_close_drawer" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#14141c] text-gray-400 hover:text-white flex items-center justify-center">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-sm"></i>
          </button>
        </div>

        <a href="https://discord.com/api/oauth2/authorize?client_id=<%= clientId || '' %>&permissions=8&scope=bot%20applications.commands" target="_blank" class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#14141c] hover:bg-red-950/40 text-red-400 transition mb-4 border border-dashed border-red-900/40 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> Thêm Server Mới
        </a>

        <div class="space-y-1.5">
          <p class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-gray-500 tracking-wider mb-2">Lãnh địa quản lý:</p>
          <% adminGuilds.forEach(function(g) { %>
            <a href="/dashboard/<%= g.id %>" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-2.5 rounded-xl transition <%= g.id === targetGuild.id ? 'bg-red-950/80 border border-red-600/60 text-white font-bold shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(220,38,38,0.25)]' : 'hover:bg-[#14141c] text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-200' %>">
              <% if (g.icon) { %>
                <img src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/icons/<%= g.id %>/<%= g.icon %>.png" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg border border-red-900/60 object-cover">
              <% } else { %>
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-white border border-gray-800"><%= g.name.charAt(0) %></div>
              <% } %>
              <span class="text-xs truncate"><%= g.name %></span>
            </a>
          <% }); %>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-red-950/60 text-center">
        <a href="/dashboard" class="text-xs text-gray-400 hover:text-white flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left text-[10px]"></i> Quay lại danh sách Server
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ================= MAIN WRAPPER (SIDEBAR + MAIN CONTENT) ================= -->
  <div class="flex-1 flex w-full">
    
    <!-- DESKTOP LEFT SIDEBAR (>= 1024px) -->
    <aside class="hidden lg:flex w-72 bg-[#0a0a0f] border-r border-red-950/80 flex-col p-4 shrink-0 justify-between">
      <div class="overflow-hidden flex flex-col flex-1">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 mb-3 border-b border-red-950/50">
          <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-server text-red-500"></i> Lãnh Địa Quản Trị
          </span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-red-400 bg-red-950/60 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono font-bold"><%= adminGuilds.length %></span>
        </div>

        <a href="https://discord.com/api/oauth2/authorize?client_id=<%= clientId || '' %>&permissions=8&scope=bot%20applications.commands" target="_blank" class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#121218] hover:bg-red-950/40 text-red-400 transition mb-3 border border-dashed border-red-900/40 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-plus text-xs"></i> <span>Thêm Server Mới</span>
        </a>

        <div class="space-y-1.5 overflow-y-auto flex-1 pr-1">
          <% adminGuilds.forEach(function(g) { %>
            <a href="/dashboard/<%= g.id %>" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-2.5 rounded-xl transition <%= g.id === targetGuild.id ? 'bg-gradient-to-r from-red-950 to-[#1e070c] border border-red-600/60 text-white font-bold shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(220,38,38,0.2)]' : 'hover:bg-[#121218] text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-200 border border-transparent' %>">
              <% if (g.icon) { %>
                <img src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/icons/<%= g.id %>/<%= g.icon %>.png" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg border border-red-900/60 object-cover shrink-0">
              <% } else { %>
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-white border border-gray-800 shrink-0"><%= g.name.charAt(0) %></div>
              <% } %>
              <span class="text-xs truncate flex-1"><%= g.name %></span>
              <% if (g.id === targetGuild.id) { %>
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500 animate-pulse"></span>
              <% } %>
            </a>
          <% }); %>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-red-950/60">
        <a href="/dashboard" class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#121218] hover:bg-[#1a1a24] text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition text-xs font-semibold">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-table-cells text-red-500"></i>
          <span>Tất Cả Máy Chủ</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <!-- MAIN DASHBOARD CONTENT AREA -->
    <main class="flex-1 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-6 w-full overflow-y-auto">
      
      <!-- Server Hero Banner -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 mb-6 relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <% if (targetGuild.icon) { %>
              <img src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/icons/<%= targetGuild.id %>/<%= targetGuild.icon %>.png" class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl border-2 border-red-700/60 object-cover shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(220,38,38,0.3)] shrink-0" alt="<%= targetGuild.name %>">
            <% } else { %>
              <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-950 to-black border-2 border-red-700/60 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-black text-red-400 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(220,38,38,0.3)] shrink-0 font-arcane">
                <%= targetGuild.name.charAt(0).toUpperCase() %>
              </div>
            <% } %>
            <div>
              <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-red-400 bg-red-950/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-red-900/40 mb-1">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-fingerprint text-xs"></i>
                <span>GIAO THỨC ĐIỀU HÀNH CHÍNH THỨC</span>
              </div>
              <h1 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-white font-arcane tracking-wide uppercase"><%= targetGuild.name %></h1>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-0.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1">
                <span><i class="fa-solid fa-users text-red-500"></i> <%= (guild && guild.memberCount) ? guild.memberCount.toLocaleString('vi-VN') : '0' %> quân số</span>
                <span><i class="fa-solid fa-hashtag text-blue-400"></i> <%= textChannels.length %> kênh text</span>
                <span><i class="fa-solid fa-volume-high text-emerald-400"></i> <%= voiceChannels.length %> kênh thoại</span>
                <span><i class="fa-solid fa-shield text-amber-400"></i> <%= roles.length %> vai trò</span>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="self-stretch sm:self-center flex sm:flex-col justify-end items-end gap-2">
            <button type="button" onclick="submitConfiguration(event)" class="w-full sm:w-auto h-11 px-6 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-red-900 via-red-800 to-red-600 hover:from-red-800 hover:to-red-500 text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition duration-200 shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(220,38,38,0.4)] border border-red-500/40">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-floppy-disk text-sm"></i>
              <span>Lưu Cấu Hình</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- TAB NAVIGATION BAR (5 TABS - SMOOTH SWITCHING) -->
      <div class="mb-6 sticky top-16 lg:top-16 z-20 bg-[#08080a]/95 backdrop-blur-xl pt-2 pb-1 border-b border-red-950/60">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 overflow-x-auto no-scrollbar pb-2">
          <button type="button" onclick="switchTab('tab_security')" id="btn_tab_security" class="tab-btn active shrink-0 h-11 px-4 sm:px-5 rounded-xl border border-red-950/60 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center gap-2 transition duration-200">
            <span>👁️</span>
            <span>1. Security Logs (13)</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" onclick="switchTab('tab_welcome')" id="btn_tab_welcome" class="tab-btn shrink-0 h-11 px-4 sm:px-5 rounded-xl border border-red-950/60 bg-[#121218]/80 text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-200 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center gap-2 transition duration-200">
            <span>🩸</span>
            <span>2. Cổng Chào Mừng</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" onclick="switchTab('tab_defense')" id="btn_tab_defense" class="tab-btn shrink-0 h-11 px-4 sm:px-5 rounded-xl border border-red-950/60 bg-[#121218]/80 text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-200 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center gap-2 transition duration-200">
            <span>🛡️</span>
            <span>3. Phòng Tuyến Bảo Mật</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" onclick="switchTab('tab_leveling')" id="btn_tab_leveling" class="tab-btn shrink-0 h-11 px-4 sm:px-5 rounded-xl border border-red-950/60 bg-[#121218]/80 text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-200 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center gap-2 transition duration-200">
            <span>🔮</span>
            <span>4. Huyết Tháp XP</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" onclick="switchTab('tab_giveaway')" id="btn_tab_giveaway" class="tab-btn shrink-0 h-11 px-4 sm:px-5 rounded-xl border border-red-950/60 bg-[#121218]/80 text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-200 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center gap-2 transition duration-200">
            <span>🏆</span>
            <span>5. Chiến Lợi Phẩm</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- MAIN FORM FOR SERVER CONFIGURATION -->
      <form id="configForm" action="/api/config/<%= targetGuild.id %>" method="POST" class="space-y-6">

        <!-- ================= TAB 1: 👁️ GIÁM SÁT 13 KÊNH SECURITY LOGS ================= -->
        <div id="tab_security" class="tab-pane space-y-5">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 pb-3 border-b border-red-950/60">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-arcane text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2 uppercase tracking-wide">
                <span>👁️</span> PHÒNG TUYẾN GIÁM SÁT TOÀN TRI (13 KÊNH SECURITY LOGS)
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-0.5">
                Chỉ định từng kênh chuyên biệt cho 13 sự kiện an ninh. Nhấn nút <strong>"Test Log"</strong> để kiểm tra độ thông suốt và kiểm chứng quyền của Bot.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 13 Security Log Cards Grid -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 gap-4">

            <!-- 1. Server Log -->
            <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-4 flex flex-col justify-between">
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="text-xl">📜</span>
                    <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">1. Server Log</h4>
                  </div>
                  <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full <%= config.server_log_channel_id ? 'bg-emerald-400' : 'bg-gray-600' %>"></span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-400 mb-3 leading-relaxed">Ghi nhận cập nhật tên, biểu tượng máy chủ, vanity URL và thay đổi cấp độ bảo mật.</p>
